  "notable_quotes": [
    "Four substituents—OH, NH2, ethoxy, and acetamido—were integrated to form isostructural MAC-4-B to MAC-4-E frameworks.",
    "MAC-4 derivatives are isoreticular 3D porous crs-type frameworks with 1D zigzag channels built from Zn3(OH)(dmtrz)3 and Zn2(COO)4 units.",
    "CO2 uptake rises with increasing functionalization and then falls, with maxima at intermediate compositions such as AB-0.5 and AC-0.5."
